Note on data files (non-code assets):

The JSON / JS data files in this repository (pe_history.json, data_cache.json,
realtime_data.js, dividend_data.json, transition_data.json, temp_history.json,
and similar) are market data retrieved at runtime from third-party public
sources (Sina Finance, via the akshare library). They are included so that the
site can be reproduced and audited without re-running every historical fetch.

The MIT License above covers the source code in this repository. It does not
grant any rights to the underlying third-party market data itself, which
remains subject to the terms of its original providers. If you redistribute
this project, verify the data licensing of your own sources before doing so.
